title: 'NonConstMethodOnConstReceiver is single-file by construction: the emit site is gated on file_classes, so a const receiver whose class lives in another file is silently unchecked'
updated_at: "2026-08-31T13:18:13Z"
---

NonConstMethodOnConstReceiver is single-file by construction: the emit site is gated on file_classes, so a const receiver whose class lives in another file is silently unchecked
